description:
Hello! We're searching for a skilled React Developer with strong background in React.js and a passion for creating engaging user interfaces.Responsibilities:
- Develop user-facing features using React.js;- Collaborate with designers to implement attractive and functional UI designs;- Optimize applications for maximum performance and scalability;- Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback to peers;- Stay updated on the latest React.js trends and best practices;Requirements:
- Proven experience as a React Developer with a portfolio of completed projects;- Proficiency in JavaScript, HTML, and CSS;- Strong understanding of React.js and its core principles;- Experience with popular React.js workflows (such as Redux or Context API);- Knowledge of frontend build tools like Webpack or Babel;- Familiarity with backend technologies (Node.js, Express.js);- Experience with GraphQL and RESTful APIs;
